==French==

===Etymology===
{{root|fr|ine-pro|*ters-}}
From {{uder|fr|fro|tost}}, from {{uder|fr|VL.||tostum}}, from the neuter of {{uder|fr|la|tostus||toasted}}, later meaning "hotly, promptly" in Vulgar Latin. Cognate to {{cog|it|tosto}}, {{cog|frp|toût}}, {{cog|ca|tost}}, {{cog|oc|tost}}, {{cog|wa|toist}}, {{cog|lld|tosc}}.

